+- Output path `data/processed/<version>/traces.parquet` plus
+  `data/processed/<version>/manifest.json`, mirroring the
+  `data/synthetic/`-style layout convention. `data/processed/` is
+  gitignored, matching `data/synthetic/` and `data/collected/`: it is
+  generated output, not source-controlled data.
+- The manifest records input sources (root paths, trace/event counts per
+  source), row counts before/after dedup, the null-handling sentinels and
+  reasons, the preprocessing schema version, and a generation timestamp --
+  everything needed to know how a given `data/processed/<version>/` was
+  produced without re-running the pipeline.
+
+What was deliberately left out:
+
+- No derived/behavioral features of any kind; Phase 6 owns feature
+  engineering.
+- No EDA plots or notebook; Phase 7 consumes this phase's output.
+- No changes to the Phase 3 schema or Phase 4 collector logic.
 
